# 🤖 Rule-Based AI Chatbot

A simple Rule-Based AI Chatbot built using Python as part of the DecodeLabs Artificial Intelligence Internship - Project 1.

## 📌 Project Overview

This chatbot responds to predefined user inputs using Python's `if-elif-else` statements. It demonstrates the fundamentals of rule-based artificial intelligence without using machine learning.

## 🚀 Features

- Greets users
- Responds to common questions
- Handles unknown inputs
- Runs continuously using a loop
- Exits gracefully on command
- Uses rule-based decision making

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python 3

## Concepts Covered

- Control Flow
- if-elif-else
- while loop
- User Input
- String Manipulation
- Rule-Based Artificial Intelligence

## ▶️ How to Run

1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/Rule-Based-AI-Chatbot.git
```

2. Navigate into the project

```bash
cd Rule-Based-AI-Chatbot
```

3. Run the chatbot

```bash
python chatbot.py
```

